{"id":"3860de69-05d2-4d25-ab07-a55d465eb9c7","revision":0,"last_node_id":9,"last_link_id":8,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-480,0],"size":[460,900],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["# Sprite Motion from Video\n\nExtracts a character-independent **motion cycle** from a video, for the\n*LTX Pose Sprite Sheet* workflow. Extract a motion once, reuse it for any character.\n\n**1. Driving video**: upload a clip of one person doing the motion. It loads at its own\nframe rate (`force_rate` 0, so no frame of a short loop is dropped); the cycle is resampled to\n24 fps, the sprite workflow's rate. Trim with `skip_first_frames` / `frame_load_cap`. Film the **same view** you'll use for the characters (front or side).\nA clip showing the motion **several times** gives the cleanest loop.\n\n**2. Skeleton**: DWPose finds the body on every frame (YOLO-NAS finds the person first; if\nit misses frames, set `bbox_detector` to `None` when the person fills the frame). Check\n*Detected skeleton*. The next node repairs common DWPose errors: left/right legs or arms\nswapped (side views, where they cross), single misplaced joints, frames with no detection.\n*Motion info* lists what it fixed.\n\n**3. Cycle**: *Sprite Motion from Video* follows the main person, fills in missed joints,\nsmooths jitter, finds one complete repeat of the motion and closes it into a loop. A walk\nacross the frame becomes a walk on the spot.\n- `video_cycle`: `detect cycle` (a clip that is exactly one loop is recognised too), or\n  `whole video is one cycle` to force it.\n- *Motion info* shows the cycle found and how well its ends match (good is < 0.3).\n- *Motion cycle preview* loops the result: check that it has no jump at the seam.\n\n**4. Save**: set `name` (e.g. `walk`, `run`, `idle`) and run. The file goes to\n`output/sprite_motions/<name>_00001_.json`.\n\n**Use it**: in *LTX Pose Sprite Sheet*, press **R** to refresh, pick the file in\n*Load Sprite Motion* (group 2b) and set motion to `from video (video_pose)`.\nMirroring to the character's facing, retargeting onto its proportions, scale and position\nall happen there.\n"],"title":"Motion from video: how to use","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":2,"type":"VHS_LoadVideo","pos":[0,0],"size":[320,600],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"meta_batch","type":"VHS_BatchManager","link":null,"shape":7},{"name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":null,"shape":7}],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[1]},{"name":"frame_count","type":"INT","links":[]},{"name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","links":[]},{"name":"video_info","type":"VHS_VIDEOINFO","links":[7]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VHS_LoadVideo","cnr_id":"comfyui-videohelpersuite"},"widgets_values":{"video":"","force_rate":0,"custom_width":0,"custom_height":0,"frame_load_cap":0,"skip_first_frames":0,"select_every_nth":1,"format":"AnimateDiff","choose video to upload":"image","videopreview":{"hidden":false,"paused":false,"params":{}}},"title":"1. Driving video (own frame rate)"},{"id":3,"type":"DWPreprocessor","pos":[340,0],"size":[320,300],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":1}],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[2]},{"name":"POSE_KEYPOINT","type":"POSE_KEYPOINT","links":[3]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"DWPreprocessor","cnr_id":"comfyui_controlnet_aux"},"widgets_values":["disable","enable","disable",768,"yolo_nas_l_fp16.onnx","dw-ll_ucoco_384_bs5.torchscript.pt","disable"],"title":"2. Detect the skeleton (DWPose, body)"},{"id":4,"type":"VHS_VideoCombine","pos":[340,330],"size":[320,560],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":2},{"name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","link":null,"shape":7},{"name":"meta_batch","type":"VHS_BatchManager","link":null,"shape":7},{"name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":null,"shape":7}],"outputs":[{"name":"Filenames","type":"VHS_FILENAMES","links":[]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VHS_VideoCombine","cnr_id":"comfyui-videohelpersuite"},"widgets_values":{"frame_rate":24,"loop_count":0,"filename_prefix":"sprite_motions/detected","format":"image/gif","pingpong":false,"save_output":false,"videopreview":{"hidden":false,"paused":false,"params":{}}},"title":"Detected skeleton"},{"id":5,"type":"SpriteMotionFromVideo","pos":[680,0],"size":[320,160],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"video_pose","type":"POSE_KEYPOINT","link":3},{"name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","link":8,"widget":{"name":"fps"}}],"outputs":[{"name":"motion","type":"POSE_KEYPOINT","links":[4]},{"name":"preview","type":"IMAGE","links":[5]},{"name":"frames","type":"INT","links":[]},{"name":"info","type":"STRING","links":[6]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"SpriteMotionFromVideo","cnr_id":"ComfyUI-SpriteTools"},"widgets_values":["detect cycle",1.0,24.0],"title":"3. Find one clean, looping cycle","color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":6,"type":"PreviewAny","pos":[680,190],"size":[320,170],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"source","type":"*","link":6}],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewAny"},"widgets_values":[],"title":"Motion info"},{"id":7,"type":"VHS_VideoCombine","pos":[680,390],"size":[320,560],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":5},{"name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","link":null,"shape":7},{"name":"meta_batch","type":"VHS_BatchManager","link":null,"shape":7},{"name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":null,"shape":7}],"outputs":[{"name":"Filenames","type":"VHS_FILENAMES","links":[]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VHS_VideoCombine","cnr_id":"comfyui-videohelpersuite"},"widgets_values":{"frame_rate":24,"loop_count":0,"filename_prefix":"sprite_motions/cycle","format":"image/gif","pingpong":false,"save_output":false,"videopreview":{"hidden":false,"paused":false,"params":{}}},"title":"Motion cycle preview (loops)"},{"id":8,"type":"SaveSpriteMotion","pos":[1020,0],"size":[300,160],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"motion","type":"POSE_KEYPOINT","link":4}],"outputs":[{"name":"file","type":"STRING","links":[]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"SaveSpriteMotion","cnr_id":"ComfyUI-SpriteTools"},"widgets_values":["walk"],"title":"4. Save the motion (output/sprite_motions)","color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":9,"type":"VHS_VideoInfoLoaded","pos":[0,630],"size":[320,130],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"video_info","type":"VHS_VIDEOINFO","link":7}],"outputs":[{"name":"fps🟦","type":"FLOAT","links":[8]},{"name":"frame_count🟦","type":"INT","links":[]},{"name":"duration🟦","type":"FLOAT","links":[]},{"name":"width🟦","type":"INT","links":[]},{"name":"height🟦","type":"INT","links":[]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VHS_VideoInfoLoaded","cnr_id":"comfyui-videohelpersuite"},"widgets_values":{},"title":"Video frame rate"}],"links":[[1,2,0,3,0,"IMAGE"],[2,3,0,4,0,"IMAGE"],[3,3,1,5,0,"POSE_KEYPOINT"],[4,5,0,8,0,"POSE_KEYPOINT"],[5,5,1,7,0,"IMAGE"],[6,5,3,6,0,"STRING"],[7,2,3,9,0,"VHS_VIDEOINFO"],[8,9,0,5,3,"FLOAT"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"Video -> motion cycle -> saved file","bounding":[-10,-40,1340,980],"color":"#8A8","font_size":24,"flags":{}}],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.6,"offset":[520,120]}},"version":0.4}